cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the trained models, please cite it as below."
title: "ConvNeXt-Transformer conclusion generation from mammography"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tamez-Research-Group/convnext-transformer-mammo-report"
url: "https://huggingface.co/lalodeavilaarm/convnext-transformer-mammo-report"
abstract: >-
  Code for "A ConvNeXt-Transformer Approach for Automated Conclusion Generation
  from Mammography". From the four screening views of a study, a ConvNeXt-Small
  encoder and a Transformer encoder-decoder generate the report conclusion:
  the BI-RADS category and its follow-up or biopsy recommendation.
keywords:
  - mammography
  - breast cancer
  - BI-RADS
  - radiology report generation
  - ConvNeXt
  - Transformer
